{"total_count":8,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70154","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70154/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70154/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70154/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70154","id":6129292974,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde88AAAABL5DP-g","number":70154,"title":"Reduce allocations in HttpMethodMatcherPolicy.GetEdges","user":{"login":"davidfowl","id":95136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfowl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"labels":[{"id":5058451585,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAQzde88AAAABLYHYgQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/pending-ci-rerun","name":"pending-ci-rerun","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"When assigned to a PR indicates that the CI checks should be rerun","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5644268170,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAQzde88AAAABUGyyig","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-routing","name":"area-routing","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: endpoint routing and URL matching","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-10-31T00:47:29Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:13:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/70154","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70154","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70154.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70154.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# Reduce allocations in HttpMethodMatcherPolicy.GetEdges\n\nReduce time and allocations in `HttpMethodMatcherPolicy.GetEdges`\n\n## Description\n\n- `GetEdges` runs for many nodes while the DFA is built. It collected a handful of edges in a `Dictionary<EdgeKey, List<Endpoint>>`, and most of its time went to growing that dictionary.\n- It now uses an insertion-ordered list with a linear search and the same key equality, so the edge order is unchanged. `EdgeKey.Equals` is case-insensitive but `GetHashCode` is ordinal. The dictionary therefore kept custom methods that differ only by case (for example `MERGE` and `merge`) as separate edges. The lookup keeps exactly that rule: an ordinal fast path, otherwise `Equals` plus a hash-code match.\n- It reuses a static array for the any-method (`*`) sentinel.\n- The lookup uses only safe code (a plain `List<T>` indexer loop), with no `CollectionsMarshal`, `Unsafe` or custom vectorization.\n- Adds a `GetEdges` benchmark to `HttpMethodMatcherPolicyBenchmark`.\n- Adds `GetEdges_CustomMethodsDifferingInCase_CreateSeparateEdgesInInsertionOrder`, which pins the existing edge order and case handling. It passes on both `main` and this branch.\n\nThere are no public API or behavior changes.\n\n### Benchmarks\n\nRelease builds of `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing.Microbenchmarks` using `main`'s source and this branch's source with the same benchmark harness. Settings: in-process toolchain, 5 warmup and 15 measured iterations, `MemoryDiagnoser`, 3 interleaved before/after rounds, Linux VM, .NET 12 alpha. Values are the mean of the 3 rounds.\n\n| Benchmark | Before | After | Alloc before | Alloc after |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| `HttpMethodMatcherPolicyBenchmark.GetEdges` (DestinationCount=3) | 628 ns | 351 ns | 1,288 B | 864 B |\n| `HttpMethodMatcherPolicyBenchmark.GetEdges` (DestinationCount=5) | 839 ns | 557 ns | 1,560 B | 1,352 B |\n| `HttpMethodMatcherPolicyBenchmark.GetEdges` (DestinationCount=11) | 1,801 ns | 1,456 ns | 3,280 B | 2,816 B |\n| `MatcherBuilderGithubBenchmark.Dfa` | 601 µs | 570 µs | 672,945 B | 644,182 B |\n\nEach round showed the same direction for `GetEdges`. The full GitHub-routes DFA build allocates 4.3% less; its time was lower in every round, but the difference is close to run-to-run noise.\n\n### Tests\n\n- `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing.Tests`: 3506/3506 passed, including the new test.\n\n**🤖 Posted by ASP.NET Core Perf 2 (AI Agent)**\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70154/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1143301,"client_id":"Iv23ctzlsVrAf9UtZ48B","slug":"copilot-swe-agent","node_id":"A_kwHNJr_OABFyBQ","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"Copilot SWE Agent","description":"","external_url":"https://github.com/features/copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","created_at":"2025-02-12T20:26:08Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T17:13:09Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","actions_variables":"read","administration":"read","agent_secrets":"read","agent_tasks":"write","agent_variables":"read","checks":"read","code_quality":"read","contents":"write","copilot_requests":"write","discussions":"write","environments":"write","gists":"write","issues":"write","metadata":"read","organization_agent_secrets":"read","organization_agent_variables":"read","organization_noodles":"write","packages":"read","plugin_gateway_connections":"write","pull_requests":"write","secrets":"read","secret_scanning_alerts":"read","security_events":"read","statuses":"read","vulnerability_alerts":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":[]},"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70210","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70210/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70210/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70210/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70210","id":6145203105,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde88AAAABMFbtfA","number":70210,"title":"Avoid per-parameter validation allocations for simple models","user":{"login":"davidfowl","id":95136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfowl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidfowl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"labels":[{"id":1118585221,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTE4NTg1MjIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-mvc","name":"area-mvc","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Includes: MVC, Actions and Controllers, Localization, CORS, most templates","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5058451585,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAQzde88AAAABLYHYgQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/pending-ci-rerun","name":"pending-ci-rerun","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"When assigned to a PR indicates that the CI checks should be rerun","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-11-01T09:08:08Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:11:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/70210","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70210","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70210.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70210.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"# Avoid per-parameter validation allocations for simple models\n\n- [x] You've read the [Contributor Guide](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/CODE-OF-CONDUCT.md).\n- [x] You've included unit or integration tests for your change, where applicable.\n- [x] You've included inline docs for your change, where applicable.\n- [ ] There's an open issue for the PR that you are making.\n\nLazily allocate validation state and stack storage for simple parameters.\n\n## Description\n\nEvery bound action or handler parameter gets its own `DefaultModelBindingContext` and `ValidationVisitor`. For the common case of simple, non-nested models (route and query scalars such as `int id` or `string name`), two allocations happened without being needed:\n\n- **`ValidationStateDictionary`** (created per binding context) eagerly allocated its inner `Dictionary<object, ValidationStateEntry>`. Most binders never add entries. The dictionary is now created on first write or when a live view (`Keys`, `Values`, enumerator) is requested. `Count`, `ContainsKey`, `TryGetValue` and the indexer getter answer from the empty state, including the `ArgumentNullException(\"key\")` for null keys.\n- **`ValidationStack`** (internal, created per `ValidationVisitor`) always allocated a `List<object>` plus its backing array as soon as the first model was pushed. Every non-null model is pushed, including boxed scalars. The first model is now kept inline, and the list is only created when a second, nested model is pushed. Cycle detection, the `CutOff` switch to `HashSet` and pop semantics are unchanged.\n\nNo public API or behavior changes.\n\n### Benchmarks\n\nNew `ParameterBinderBenchmark`: binds and validates `int id` (route) and `string name` (query) through `ParameterBinder`, as `ControllerBinderDelegateProvider` does per request. BDN perflab config, 3 interleaved rounds:\n\n| Round | main | PR |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 1.643 µs / 3981 B | 1.487 µs / 3654 B |\n| 2 | 1.713 µs / 3981 B | 1.571 µs / 3654 B |\n| 3 | 1.650 µs / 3981 B | 1.697 µs / 3654 B |\n\nThat is **−327 B (−8.2%)** per request with 2 simple parameters; time is roughly −5% and noisy.\n\nEnd-to-end in-process MVC pipeline (allocated bytes per request):\n\n| Scenario | main | PR |\n|---|---|---|\n| `[ApiController]` GET with route + query params | 6888 B | 6568 B (−4.6%) |\n| Razor Page POST (bound properties + handler) | 9673 B | 9441 B |\n| `[ApiController]` JSON POST | 7603 B | 7531 B |\n\n### Tests\n\n- New `ValidationStateDictionaryTest`: empty-state reads, null-key exceptions before and after the first add, live `Keys`/`Values` views and reference equality.\n- New `ValidationStackTest` cases cover the single-model to list transition and pop with null.\n- Mvc.Abstractions.Test: 254 passed. Mvc.Core.Test: 4512 passed. Mvc.IntegrationTests: 812 passed.\n\n**🤖 Posted by ASP.NET Core Perf 2 (AI Agent)**\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70210/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70210/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1143301,"client_id":"Iv23ctzlsVrAf9UtZ48B","slug":"copilot-swe-agent","node_id":"A_kwHNJr_OABFyBQ","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"Copilot SWE Agent","description":"","external_url":"https://github.com/features/copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","created_at":"2025-02-12T20:26:08Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T17:13:09Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","actions_variables":"read","administration":"read","agent_secrets":"read","agent_tasks":"write","agent_variables":"read","checks":"read","code_quality":"read","contents":"write","copilot_requests":"write","discussions":"write","environments":"write","gists":"write","issues":"write","metadata":"read","organization_agent_secrets":"read","organization_agent_variables":"read","organization_noodles":"write","packages":"read","plugin_gateway_connections":"write","pull_requests":"write","secrets":"read","secret_scanning_alerts":"read","security_events":"read","statuses":"read","vulnerability_alerts":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":[]},"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/67248","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/67248/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/67248/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/67248/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/67248","id":4677941513,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde87nMs3-","number":67248,"title":"